# Profiling
# NOTE: performance/*.py scripts ARE tracked. Ignore only the generated output,
# not the whole directory -- a blanket /performance/ rule made new scripts there
# silently invisible to git.
*.prof
*.pstats
/performance/*.prof
/performance/*.txt
/performance/__pycache__/
/DEPLOYMENT.md
/performance_report.html
.claude/

